# Layers

Pages + features compose. Domain never imports sibling domain. Third-party calls live only in `services/integrations`. No `workflows/` folder.

```
page / feature    → data actions, domain, services
data actions      → dto, dal, domain, services
dto               → (pure)
dal               → services/db, services/integrations
domain/<entity>   → utilities   (NOT data, NOT services, NOT sibling domain)
services          → utilities
```

| Layer | Owns |
|-------|------|
| `src/pages/` | Routes + API routes (thin) |
| `src/features/` | Visitor jobs, UI |
| `src/data/<Entity>/{dto,dal}` | Transform, D1 (via `services/db`) and Stripe calls (via the registry) |
| `src/domain/<entity>/` | Order status rules, basket totals |
| `src/services/db/` | D1 binding wrapper only |
| `src/services/integrations/` | Closed operation registry + vendor handlers (`external-integrations.mdc`) |
| `src/stores/` | Client stores (basket) |
| `src/utilities/` | Pure helpers |

See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.
